 "title": "Ricercar (skeleton) - piano quintet",
 "comment": "Shostakovich Op. 57 model. Positions are section marks from design/final-lab/piece.py, so the scoring follows the form when bars are inserted. Quartet alone through the exposition, stretto, Climax I and the arioso dolente; the alto's lament countersubject dips below the violin (F3, expo bars 9-12) and goes to the viola while the tenor still rests. The piano enters alone with the Fuga inversa; the viola brings the tenor's stretto entry (inversa+2). Over the dominant pedal the cello holds the augmented inversion with a piano F1 pedal point under it, and the tenor's S1 entry (pedal_climax+2) is the piano's colour while the viola rests. Climax II (pedal_climax+4) and the apotheosis are tutti with octave doublings (piano soprano 8va, bass 8vb).",
